\ '[+-]\=\s*\%(\d\+\%([.,]\d*\)\=\|[.,]\d\+\)\s*\%(true\)\=\s*\%(p[tc]\|in\|bp\|c[mc]\|m[mu]\|dd\|sp\|e[mx]\)\>'
